<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57792" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλέμμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλέπτω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>thing stolen</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hec.</u>
				618
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				952a19
			</span></i>; <i>money equivalent of thing stolen</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ κ. ἐκτείσας διπλοῦν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					857b
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Foed.Delph.Pell.</u>
				2
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				5(1).1390.77
			</span></i> (Andania, <span class="entity">i B.C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>theft</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ichn.</u>
				67
			</span></i> (pl., lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				1203
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				15.1.53
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>stratagem</i> in war, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				5.9
			</span></i>; <i>fraud</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.31
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.100
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἐρωτικόν</span>
			<i>clandestine</i> amour, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				1.2
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				5.17
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Rufin.
			</span></i>).</div>
